{"id":"rg1-ra-claim-001","question":"Fact-check this claim and give a verdict with the main reasons: \"A chimeric Pfizer/Moderna spike sequence integrated into chromosome 19 of a bladder-cancer patient — 1-in-a-trillion odds of being an anomaly.\"","reference_answer":"Verdict: misleading. A single chimeric sequencing read in one case report is not evidence of vaccine DNA integration. A case report in a Beall's-list journal describes one chimeric read in cell-free plasma DNA that the authors call integration into chromosome 19. One chimeric read with no orthogonal validation is a sequencing artifact, not integration; the \"20/20 bp match\" and \"1-in-a-trillion\" framings misuse statistics; the spike sequence is not unique to the vaccine; and the authors have major conflicts of interest.","source_repo":"midnghtsapphire/risingaloha","source_path":"data/debunks.json","source_sha":"83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee","source_blob_sha":"0e03fe88711a5a41e626548b3d5b2c42c163d2e9","source_locator":"mrna-chromosome-19-integration","source_url":"https://github.com/midnghtsapphire/risingaloha/blob/83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee/data/debunks.json","domain":"health-claims/fact-check","difficulty":null,"question_form":"claim_verification","label":"misleading","caveat":null,"visibility":"public","question_sha256":"4e258f088b55ceaf96db1d83fa4f90273e1116bea88cbb67ccfa095741291809","reference_sha256":"39ae45b4928c3dcf12cc238f6cc3f0fcfb90155e9554f70b261d5798e97704f5"}
{"id":"rg1-ra-claim-002","question":"Fact-check this claim and give a verdict with the main reasons: \"Ivermectin is a proven cure for COVID-19.\"","reference_answer":"Verdict: false. Large randomized trials show no clinically meaningful benefit of ivermectin for COVID-19. The largest randomized controlled trials (TOGETHER, ACTIV-6, PRINCIPLE) found no clinically meaningful benefit of ivermectin for COVID-19 on hospitalization, recovery time, or mortality. Smaller early-pandemic signals did not hold up on replication; the most widely circulated meta-analysis was withdrawn after fabricated data were identified in an included study.","source_repo":"midnghtsapphire/risingaloha","source_path":"data/debunks.json","source_sha":"83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee","source_blob_sha":"0e03fe88711a5a41e626548b3d5b2c42c163d2e9","source_locator":"ivermectin-cures-covid","source_url":"https://github.com/midnghtsapphire/risingaloha/blob/83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee/data/debunks.json","domain":"health-claims/fact-check","difficulty":null,"question_form":"claim_verification","label":"false","caveat":null,"visibility":"public","question_sha256":"cd6677d85acd64adc80855360a08cb007068ece81af2f8b88916b1e4d0d8ed3f","reference_sha256":"e19c0b8ecf76b5c67ce65bf7c969659929f05bff32b56e88d41effa18cd891bc"}
{"id":"rg1-ra-claim-003","question":"Fact-check this claim and give a verdict with the main reasons: \"COVID-19 vaccines contain microchips or tracking devices.\"","reference_answer":"Verdict: false. There is no electronic component in any authorized COVID-19 vaccine; the volume alone makes it physically impossible. Authorized COVID-19 vaccines contain mRNA or viral vector DNA, lipids, salts, and sugars. No integrated circuit small enough to pass through a vaccine needle and remain functional has been demonstrated, and independent chemical analyses of vials across the Pfizer, Moderna, and J&J products have found only the ingredients listed on the FDA fact sheets.","source_repo":"midnghtsapphire/risingaloha","source_path":"data/debunks.json","source_sha":"83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee","source_blob_sha":"0e03fe88711a5a41e626548b3d5b2c42c163d2e9","source_locator":"covid-vaccines-microchips","source_url":"https://github.com/midnghtsapphire/risingaloha/blob/83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee/data/debunks.json","domain":"health-claims/fact-check","difficulty":null,"question_form":"claim_verification","label":"false","caveat":null,"visibility":"public","question_sha256":"19919d115d49e4082358925cd8aafe5c1208e8f2cdd0716a57d4bff52cf2c08f","reference_sha256":"9d5ce0b8653aafdb64267ef13aef2469fbe825cb44c2f4d83d00a5bc7115c41f"}
{"id":"rg1-ra-claim-004","question":"Fact-check this claim and give a verdict with the main reasons: \"mRNA-vaccinated people \"shed\" vaccine components and harm unvaccinated people around them.\"","reference_answer":"Verdict: false. mRNA vaccines contain no live virus and cannot shed. Shedding is a property of live-attenuated viral vaccines (e.g. some oral polio formulations). mRNA vaccines contain synthetic mRNA inside lipid nanoparticles — no replicating virus, no viable particle to shed. The claim conflates two unrelated vaccine platforms.","source_repo":"midnghtsapphire/risingaloha","source_path":"data/debunks.json","source_sha":"83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee","source_blob_sha":"0e03fe88711a5a41e626548b3d5b2c42c163d2e9","source_locator":"mrna-vaccine-shedding","source_url":"https://github.com/midnghtsapphire/risingaloha/blob/83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee/data/debunks.json","domain":"health-claims/fact-check","difficulty":null,"question_form":"claim_verification","label":"false","caveat":null,"visibility":"public","question_sha256":"d066bad10919f529adc855e4b2fbdd42bad546d24c912693f9d5a304019794db","reference_sha256":"897672703249ae5dd8963dfbb0218afb901c348a7588bddd7389fc184c1e1741"}
{"id":"rg1-ra-claim-005","question":"Fact-check this claim and give a verdict with the main reasons: \"Natural immunity from infection is always stronger and safer than vaccine immunity.\"","reference_answer":"Verdict: mixed. Post-infection immunity is real but comes at the cost of the infection itself; hybrid immunity (infection + vaccination) is generally the strongest. Studies show infection-derived immunity provides substantial protection against reinfection and severe disease, often comparable to or exceeding primary-series vaccination for the same variant. But that protection only exists after surviving the infection, which carries non-trivial risk of hospitalization, Long COVID, and death. Multiple large cohort studies show the strongest and most durable protection is hybrid immunity (prior infection plus vaccination).","source_repo":"midnghtsapphire/risingaloha","source_path":"data/debunks.json","source_sha":"83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee","source_blob_sha":"0e03fe88711a5a41e626548b3d5b2c42c163d2e9","source_locator":"natural-immunity-always-better","source_url":"https://github.com/midnghtsapphire/risingaloha/blob/83a727d46540788a17ecd851d62bb804e33ebcee/data/debunks.json","domain":"health-claims/fact-check","difficulty":null,"question_form":"claim_verification","label":"mixed","caveat":null,"visibility":"public","question_sha256":"da74c3f7102aa81fb23180a5cc8529a94f90740de99fcdf7ad74157ebf953c03","reference_sha256":"01c3e0a175c1fb940fb0ab618ff62a15e7b64f9f2ccd3b0a598f88290ee261bd"}
